<div class="n-label">Niwot today</div>
<h2 class="n-h2" id="today-h" style="margin-top:12px;max-width:18ch">A community of about four thousand people.</h2>
</div>
<div>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:0;max-width:62ch;color:var(--n-paper)">Two commercial clusters, a historic district, and farmland that starts where the sidewalks stop. Services come from Boulder County and a set of special districts rather than a town government, and in November 2026 residents inside a proposed boundary vote on whether that should change.</p>
